{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For a given arithmetic series the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, and the sum of the next <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/9/ba95523c84fb74066f8bae3b93acf8f70025f0c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2700$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />. \nThe first term in the series is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/50900576be0ac5d8207b469655ef946568473621.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -1221 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -21.5 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ -20.5 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 3.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"503\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the first term of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetic_sequence\" title=\"Arithmetic sequence\">arithmetic sequence</a> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and the common difference be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02cda035ff790c0c05f0ea09c1a9739d1a0bc507.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> term of the sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/c/25c0a9ef13a58828b6f8ba0d501483122d7b9e09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+49d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />, so the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/6/64673289c35fc0ab3ba7faa91807cd070b167fa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{50(a + a + 49d)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"126\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65a35f6a58d90eb231fe087cd30de1e960ebdc12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$51^{\\text{th}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"30\" height=\"16\" /> term of the sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84ce673854e85e7eb7135083319831f53bcaef11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+50d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d03d1fb723b8ac427ccfcf63129a2b454d2d75fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100^{\\text{th}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"16\" /> term of the sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/a/34ac3cfd92bf9753ab0617cef5e25ffa7847099a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+99d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />, so the sum of the next <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/a/afacf06162ccf6efd09b622e6922bcdfd8fd6ee7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{50(a+50d+a+99d)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"179\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting in values results in this <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=System_of_equations\" title=\"System of equations\">system of equations</a>.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/0/0f0a22c9b30a18794b65bac55dedea966df6b8e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a+49d=8\\]\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/c/3ec72eaa5bd65899b44ed0dddf9b6260ec7619a8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a+149d=108\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"14\" />\nSolving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6cd16fdb3ecf46bd5954f8bd83f42fafd45517.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{-41}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"68\" height=\"37\" />.  The first term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/1/21188303d85a29a2da739f077134b02ce677e91a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-20.5$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Same as solution 1 but faster.\n</p><p>Theory:\nIn an AP, we can write\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/0/bc0f163f1da4752004c4001c22ec88a38dfefe78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_n = An^2+Bn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"20\" />, where common difference(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/5/f45398b4c899e250c3cfa9f2d658b4ae42afe215.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d) = 2A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"65\" height=\"20\" /> and first term(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/8/588f01734d711dd8c6ff242a5be8266c4dd5c794.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a) = A(1^2)+B(1) = A+B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"222\" height=\"21\" /> \n</p><p>This is already known, and not part of the solution&#160;:) .\n</p><p>So, given:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/b/c0bfdc495d21b73e77db095795754a8e3dbf81e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{50} = 2500A+50B=200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"208\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/7/1b79b30368cb618c770b0b482296609fcda6eaa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{100} - S_{50} = 7500A+50B=2700$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"271\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/3/3b38d0b5096b501e0e8437d73ac696a376dc5ee4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies A=0.5 \\text{ and } B = -21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"216\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b7149f5a2211e2b0dd5ffa5a77edb37089b6b326.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies \\text{first term} = A+B = \\boxed{\\textbf{ -20.5 (C) }}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"313\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~Raghav Mukhija(AOPS - CatalanThinker)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table> \n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017163528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 280/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2984/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 196/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5493/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.378      1 -total\n 63.25%    9.094      1 Template:AHSME_40p_box\n 34.63%    4.979      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16286:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017163528 and revision id 255881. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}